{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q042","number":42,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"经理对大家这次的工作很（ ），还请我们吃了饭。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"画家"},{"id":"B","text":"更"},{"id":"C","text":"满意"},{"id":"D","text":"种"},{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q043","number":43,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"我们办公室的同事都很（ ），最大的才二十八岁。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"画家"},{"id":"B","text":"更"},{"id":"C","text":"满意"},{"id":"D","text":"种"},{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q044","number":44,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"这几年我们城市发展很快，马路比以前（ ）干净了。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"画家"},{"id":"B","text":"更"},{"id":"C","text":"满意"},{"id":"D","text":"种"},{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q045","number":45,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"我们班的留学生（ ）十几个国家，平时都说汉语。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"画家"},{"id":"B","text":"更"},{"id":"C","text":"满意"},{"id":"D","text":"种"},{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q046","number":46,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":"第二部分\n第 46～50 题","prompt":"A：你的（ ）怎么放在办公室里？\nB：我下班以后就去机场，要坐晚上的飞机。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q047","number":47,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：我儿子说他今天的作业都做完了。\nB：你（ ）他吗？我觉得你还是检查一下吧。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q048","number":48,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：真（ ），今天教室里怎么一个人也没有？\nB：你忘了吗？今天学校放假，不上课。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q049","number":49,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：你的汉语考试成绩出来了吗？\nB：出来了，我准备了半年，这次（ ）考到了九十分！","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q050","number":50,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：新来的同事怎么样？\nB：她（ ）工作认真，而且总是愿意帮助别人。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q051","number":51,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":"第三部分\n第 51～60 题","prompt":"★ 关于小美，可以知道什么？","passage":"小美是我的留学生朋友。刚来中国时，她不会用筷子，吃饭很慢。后来她每天晚饭都练习，现在已经用得跟我一样好了。","passageId":"p051","options":[{"id":"A","text":"早上练习"},{"id":"B","text":"会用筷子了"},{"id":"C","text":"比我用得更好"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q052","number":52,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 姐姐让“我”怎么做？","passage":"我和姐姐周六要坐汽车去外地看奶奶，路上得四个多小时。听说车上没有卫生间，姐姐让我少喝点儿水，等中间休息的时候再去卫生间。","passageId":"p052","options":[{"id":"A","text":"别喝太多水"},{"id":"B","text":"多带些矿泉水"},{"id":"C","text":"休息时下车买水"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q053","number":53,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 他这次请假是为了：","passage":"下星期三下午我要带儿子去办护照，所以得请半天假。我已经给经理发了邮件，他同意了。那天下午的工作，我会请同事小宋帮忙做完。","passageId":"p053","options":[{"id":"A","text":"帮小宋做事"},{"id":"B","text":"给儿子办护照"},{"id":"C","text":"去学校接儿子放学"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q054","number":54,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于叔叔的新家，可以知道什么？","passage":"我叔叔去年把家搬到了公园旁边。新家离公司比较远，房子也不太大，但是附近环境很好，夏天的晚上特别凉快，所以叔叔很满意。","passageId":"p054","options":[{"id":"A","text":"今年刚搬过去"},{"id":"B","text":"夏天白天凉快"},{"id":"C","text":"离上班的地方挺远"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q055","number":55,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 中午去那家饭馆，能吃到什么？","passage":"我家附近有一家饭馆，包子做得特别好吃，可是每天只做两百个，上午就卖完了。想吃的话，最好早点儿去；中午再去，就只能吃米饭和鸡蛋了。","passageId":"p055","options":[{"id":"A","text":"包子和米饭"},{"id":"B","text":"鸡蛋和包子"},{"id":"C","text":"米饭和鸡蛋"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q056","number":56,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 根据这段话，下班以后：","passage":"夏天天气热，孙经理下班前只让大家关电脑，空调不用关，因为晚上有阿姨来打扫办公室。等同事们都走了，他才放心地回家。","passageId":"p056","options":[{"id":"A","text":"空调没关"},{"id":"B","text":"电脑还开着"},{"id":"C","text":"经理先回家了"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q057","number":57,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 丁丽现在一般什么时候复习？","passage":"丁丽住的屋子离马路很近，外面汽车的声音很大，书常常看不进去。快考试了，她决定每天早上五点起床，洗完脸就开始复习。同学告诉她，只要用耳机听音乐，就看得进去了。她试了一下，发现还是听得见外面的声音，没什么用。","passageId":"p057","options":[{"id":"A","text":"起床后"},{"id":"B","text":"下课以后"},{"id":"C","text":"晚上睡觉前"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q058","number":58,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 根据这段话，丁丽：","passage":"丁丽住的屋子离马路很近，外面汽车的声音很大，书常常看不进去。快考试了，她决定每天早上五点起床，洗完脸就开始复习。同学告诉她，只要用耳机听音乐，就看得进去了。她试了一下，发现还是听得见外面的声音，没什么用。","passageId":"p057","options":[{"id":"A","text":"每天用耳机听歌"},{"id":"B","text":"早上五点去上课"},{"id":"C","text":"觉得耳机帮助不大"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q059","number":59,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 以前儿子遇到难题时，会怎么样？","passage":"我儿子今年上三年级。以前他一遇到难题就哭，我爱人总是马上过去帮他做。后来我们决定不再这样了，让他自己先多想一想，真的不会了，才可以来问我们。现在他做作业认真多了，有时候还给同学讲题呢。","passageId":"p059","options":[{"id":"A","text":"哭起来"},{"id":"B","text":"自己想想"},{"id":"C","text":"给同学讲题"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q060","number":60,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 儿子什么时候才可以去问爸爸妈妈？","passage":"我儿子今年上三年级。以前他一遇到难题就哭，我爱人总是马上过去帮他做。后来我们决定不再这样了，让他自己先多想一想，真的不会了，才可以来问我们。现在他做作业认真多了，有时候还给同学讲题呢。","passageId":"p059","options":[{"id":"A","text":"刚看到题时"},{"id":"B","text":"想过了还不会"},{"id":"C","text":"爸爸下班回家后"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false}]},{"id":"writing","title":"Writing","questions":[{"id":"xh30-3-07-q061","number":61,"type":"character_fill","instruction":"第一部分\n第 61～65 题","prompt":"这把（ ）子有点儿脏，请帮我换一把干净的，好吗？","pinyin":"sháo","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q062","number":62,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"经理，您发来的邮件我已经（ ）到了。","pinyin":"shōu","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q063","number":63,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"我刚（ ）给你打了三次电话，你怎么都没接？","pinyin":"cái","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q064","number":64,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"我来北方工作两年了，现在已经习惯这里的生（ ）了。","pinyin":"huó","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q065","number":65,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"老师说，这些作业（ ）须在星期五以前完成。","pinyin":"bì","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q066","number":66,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":"第二部分\n第 66～70 题","prompt":"检查","options":[],"images":["assets/q066.ca6be500ca25.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Bác sĩ đang dùng ống nghe khám sức khỏe cho một cậu bé."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q067","number":67,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"体育馆","options":[],"images":["assets/q067.831d5731c723.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Hai chàng trai đang chơi bóng rổ trong một nhà thi đấu thể thao lớn trong nhà."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q068","number":68,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"方便面","options":[],"images":["assets/q068.f655986a98d7.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một nhân viên nam ngồi ở bàn làm việc đầy giấy tờ, vừa nhìn màn hình máy tính vừa ăn mì ăn liền trong cốc."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q069","number":69,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"热情","options":[],"images":["assets/q069.594d9d00454c.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Cô bán hoa quả tươi cười đưa túi táo cho một cô gái trẻ và tặng thêm một quả táo."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-07-q070","number":70,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"照顾","options":[],"images":["assets/q070.5da687b17c73.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một cô gái trẻ ngồi bên giường bệnh, đỡ lưng và đưa cốc nước cho một ông cụ trong bệnh viện."],"needsReview":false}]}],"examples":[{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 1～5 题","prompt":"女：欢迎来我家！今天请你吃我们北方的面条儿。\n男：太好了，我早就想尝尝了。","options":[{"id":"A","text":""},{"id":"B","text":""},{"id":"C","text":""},{"id":"D","text":""},{"id":"E","text":""},{"id":"F","text":""}],"images":["assets/q001-bank-A.e2e7adb93fe5.jpg","assets/q001-bank-B.489fb241a24c.jpg","assets/q001-bank-C.ce1f0950edc4.jpg","assets/q001-bank-D.3b70f758913e.jpg","assets/q001-bank-E.78da96df3ba2.jpg","assets/q001-bank-F.df210fb5b1f4.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một người đàn ông đang tắt đèn ở phòng họp không có ai.","Một người mẹ nắm tay con gái khoảng năm tuổi, hai mẹ con có đôi mắt giống nhau.","Trong cửa hàng quần áo, một người đàn ông cầm chiếc quần đùi lên xem, bên cạnh có một người phụ nữ.","Ở nhà, một người phụ nữ mời một người đàn ông ngồi vào bàn có hai bát mì nóng.","Trong lớp học, một cô giáo đang viết chữ lên bảng đen.","Ở cổng vào ga tàu điện ngầm, một người đàn ông lấy thẻ ra để quẹt, bên cạnh có một người phụ nữ."],"answer":"D","fromNumber":1,"toNumber":5},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 11～20 题","prompt":"女：明天的音乐表演，你会参加吗？\n男：不参加了，我要帮妹妹复习数学。\n问：男的明天要做什么？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"参加表演"},{"id":"B","text":"帮妹妹学习"},{"id":"C","text":"和妹妹去看表演"}],"images":[],"answer":"B","fromNumber":11,"toNumber":20},{"instruction":"第三部分\n第 21～30 题","prompt":"这个周六晚上有音乐节目，咱们别在家看电视了，一起去听吧。\n问：说话人想周六晚上做什么？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"看电视"},{"id":"B","text":"听音乐"},{"id":"C","text":"在家休息"}],"images":[],"answer":"B","fromNumber":21,"toNumber":30},{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 31～35 题","prompt":"你的感冒好了吗？明天能来上课吗？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不认得，我一出门就找不到方向了。"},{"id":"B","text":"明天要在会议上介绍我们的工作，我心里有点儿担心。"},{"id":"C","text":"好，我明白了，以后我自己出门也能叫车了。"},{"id":"D","text":"好多了，但是医生让我在家再休息一天。"},{"id":"E","text":"跑步跑了半天，我现在又累又渴。"},{"id":"F","text":"对，这样可以锻炼身体，我已经习惯了。"}],"images":[],"answer":"D","fromNumber":31,"toNumber":35},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 41～45 题","prompt":"下个月，一位有名的（ ）要来我们市里给大家介绍他的画。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"画家"},{"id":"B","text":"更"},{"id":"C","text":"满意"},{"id":"D","text":"种"},{"id":"E","text":"年轻"},{"id":"F","text":"来自"}],"images":[],"answer":"A","fromNumber":41,"toNumber":45},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 46～50 题","prompt":"A：你怎么又买了一（ ）鞋？\nB：这是给我弟弟买的，他下星期开学要穿。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不但"},{"id":"B","text":"双"},{"id":"C","text":"相信"},{"id":"D","text":"奇怪"},{"id":"E","text":"行李"},{"id":"F","text":"终于"}],"images":[],"answer":"B","fromNumber":46,"toNumber":50},{"instruction":"第三部分\n第 51～60 题","prompt":"我们班这个学期一共有二十个学生，男生只有六个，女生有十四个。考试考得最好的也常常是女生。\n★ 关于他们班，可以知道什么？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"女生比较多"},{"id":"B","text":"男生成绩最好"},{"id":"C","text":"一共十四个人"}],"images":[],"answer":"A","fromNumber":51,"toNumber":60},{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 61～65 题","prompt":"我是在南方出生的，那里一年（ ）季都能买到新鲜水果。","pinyin":"sì","options":[],"images":[],"answer":"四","fromNumber":61,"toNumber":65},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 66～70 题","prompt":"累","options":[],"images":["assets/q066-example.3b202bf02c73.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Buổi tối ở văn phòng, một cô gái trẻ ngả lưng trên ghế, nhắm mắt xoa gáy, trông rất mệt."],"answer":"她工作了一天，感到很累。","fromNumber":66,"toNumber":70}],"questionCount":70,"hasAudio":true,"audioUrl":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-audio/xh30-3-07/full.b1873464ec5d.mp3","images":[{"path":"assets/q001-bank-A.e2e7adb93fe5.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-A.e2e7adb93fe5.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-B.489fb241a24c.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-B.489fb241a24c.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-C.ce1f0950edc4.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-C.ce1f0950edc4.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-D.3b70f758913e.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-D.3b70f758913e.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-E.78da96df3ba2.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-E.78da96df3ba2.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-F.df210fb5b1f4.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q001-bank-F.df210fb5b1f4.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-A.9db91ebeab4d.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q006-bank-A.9db91ebeab4d.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-B.8e42f25e5fbc.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q006-bank-B.8e42f25e5fbc.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-C.a30a67b78e4c.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q006-bank-C.a30a67b78e4c.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-D.212f776db60a.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q006-bank-D.212f776db60a.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-E.fe0f62bc1155.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q006-bank-E.fe0f62bc1155.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q066.ca6be500ca25.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q066.ca6be500ca25.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q067.831d5731c723.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q067.831d5731c723.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q068.f655986a98d7.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q068.f655986a98d7.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q069.594d9d00454c.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q069.594d9d00454c.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q070.5da687b17c73.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q070.5da687b17c73.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q066-example.3b202bf02c73.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-07/assets/q066-example.3b202bf02c73.jpg"}]}